帛之幣以聘享諸侯，所至，國君無不分庭與之抗禮。夫使孔子名布揚於天下者，子貢先後之也。此所謂得埶而益彰者乎？"}],"prior_source_qualifications":[{"metadata":{"label":"原憲（貨殖列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"source_mention_ids":["c-shiji-129-huozhi:m008-0037"],"original_registry_record_sha256":"11f94fbd7e8c79debc338bdd188518fd0fd9b14e45906cfb020f118b5acf7347","qualification":"原來源人物所有非alias/evidence欄位逐值保留；只辨同指，不提高史實或引古事件資格。"}],"rationale":"孔門弟子原憲與子貢貧富對舉；067子貢結駟連騎訪窮巷、原憲貧而非病，129同列孔子七十子、子貢仕衛結駟連騎與原憲糟糠窮巷，具共同人物圈及特定對照敘事橋，非僅同名。","interpretation_note":"129為財富議論，067為弟子敘事，124亦引古貧士；合人不把修辭描寫當新增日期／貧困事件。原憲字子思不接孔伋之子思。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p068","text":"原憲字子思。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m068-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"原憲","kind":"person","person_id":"b26_2bj_z9b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m068-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"子思","kind":"person","person_id":"b26_2bj_z9b","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","book_id":"b-shiji-067","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p069","text":"子思問恥。孔子曰：「國有道，穀。國無道，穀，恥也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m069-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"子思","kind":"person","person_id":"b26_2bj_z9b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m069-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","book_id":"b-shiji-067","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p070","text":"子思曰：「克、伐、怨、欲不行焉，可以爲仁乎？」孔子曰：「可以爲難矣，仁則吾弗知也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","menti